{"id":"07987a632b1cbf1a","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-structural-rule.md","title":"Structural Rule","display":"df-structural-rule — Structural Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-structural-rule","aliases":["72-df-structural-rule"],"display":"df-structural-rule — Structural Rule","depends_on":["[[72-df-weakening]]","[[72-df-contraction]]","[[72-df-exchange]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §§1.2.1–1.2.2; print10–12/PDF22–24; explicit local encoding","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-structural-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-structural-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structural-rule — Structural Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db558ef17df6892e\" href=\"?note=db558ef17df6892e\" title=\"72-df-weakening\">72-df-weakening</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8d7c19b195bb17fe\" href=\"?note=8d7c19b195bb17fe\" title=\"72-df-contraction\">72-df-contraction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e18594e1037dd7cd\" href=\"?note=e18594e1037dd7cd\" title=\"72-df-exchange\">72-df-exchange</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §§1.2.1–1.2.2; print10–12/PDF22–24; explicit local encoding"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的五分量签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\">\\(X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有限序列以自然数为定义域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\">\\(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Gamma\">\\(A,\\Gamma\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\\)</span>。多个逗号按次序串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a> 的语法有序对。</li>\n<li>本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Sigma:=\\operatorname{Weakening}\\cup\\operatorname{Contraction}\\cup\\operatorname{Exchange},\\qquad\\operatorname{StructRules}:=\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Sigma:=\\operatorname{Weakening}\\cup\\operatorname{Contraction}\\cup\\operatorname{Exchange},\\qquad\\operatorname{StructRules}:=\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma:=\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{WL}}(\\operatorname{Weakening}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{WR}}(\\operatorname{Weakening}_R)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{CL}}(\\operatorname{Contraction}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{CR}}(\\operatorname{Contraction}_R)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\operatorname{Exchange}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{ER}}(\\operatorname{Exchange}_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma:=\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{WL}}(\\operatorname{Weakening}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{WR}}(\\operatorname{Weakening}_R)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{CL}}(\\operatorname{Contraction}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{CR}}(\\operatorname{Contraction}_R)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\operatorname{Exchange}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{ER}}(\\operatorname{Exchange}_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本接口的Struct是书中weak structural rules；Cut单独加入。规则投影不在此凭空定义，改由五元ProofTree的真实η读取。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-weakening","status":"resolved","id":"db558ef17df6892e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-weakening]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-contraction","status":"resolved","id":"8d7c19b195bb17fe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-contraction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-exchange","status":"resolved","id":"e18594e1037dd7cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-exchange]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df