ame{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Sigma:=\\operatorname{Weakening}\\cup\\operatorname{Contraction}\\cup\\operatorname{Exchange},\\qquad\\operatorname{StructRules}:=\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Sigma.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma:=\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{WL}}(\\operatorname{Weakening}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{WR}}(\\operatorname{Weakening}_R)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{CL}}(\\operatorname{Contraction}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{CR}}(\\operatorname{Contraction}_R)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\operatorname{Exchange}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{ER}}(\\operatorname{Exchange}_R).","display":true}],"bytes":2231,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-structural-rule|df-structural-rule — Structural Rule]]"},{"id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma$ 见 [[72-df-sequent-axiom]]；$\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma$ 见 [[72-df-structural-rule]]。$\\mathcal J=\\{\\bot L,\\neg L,\\land L,\\lor L,\\to L,\\forall L,\\exists R,\\top R,\\neg R,\\land R,\\lor R,\\to R\\}$ 是以下公式中枚举的规则关系族，$t_R$ 为与各关系名对应的固定互异标签。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-structural-rule|df-structural-rule — Structural Rule]]"}],"outgoing":["db558ef17df6892e","8d7c19b195bb17fe","e18594e1037dd7cd","d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","3c073b947b255638","f9452e4a7788a117"]}